{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依建築法第一百條規定訂定之。","id":"D0070153/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"5f68ba380d493fe0503c2b944599e0c627faa50726cd1cb6ac077a111b15cf4d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":17,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"土地所有權人得自行或提供他人申請左列建築使用。但其他法令有禁止或限制規定者，依其規定：\n一、建築面積不得超過三百三十平方公尺之自用農舍。\n二、菇寮、花棚、養魚池及其他供農業使用之建築物。\n三、發展交通、設立學校及興辦其他公共設施或公用事業之建築物。\n四、原有建築物之修建或改建。\n前項第一款興建自用農舍之起造人，應具自耕農身分，且建築面積不得超過耕地面積百分之五。\n第一項第三款建築物之建蔽率不得超過百分之七十。","id":"D0070153/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"74bcc5bafafe62e93a6d97dbc8bc7419bae6e976d392b7a3abcac6270f4f99aa","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":140,"children":[{"id":"D0070153/a:2/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":44,"end":69,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:2/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":69,"end":94,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:2/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":94,"end":125,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:2/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":125,"end":140,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070153/a:2/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":140,"end":183,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:2/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":183,"end":206,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"前條第一項所定建築物之構造及高度應受左列規定之限制：\n一、第一款、第二款建築物及第四款改建之建築物，其構造以木竹造、磚造及金屬架構式構造等之平房為限，簷高不得超過三點五公尺。斜屋頂屋架高度不得超過二公尺。\n二、第三款建築物構造除前款規定外，得使用鋼筋混凝土構造，高度應在三層或十點五公尺以下。\n三、第四款修建之建築物以使用原有材料為限。","id":"D0070153/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"b041d6f456c83b50d22fdf13e0ce44059bf8b8fbdd07047132eb0dda27959ae7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":168,"children":[{"id":"D0070153/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":27,"end":103,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":103,"end":147,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:3/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":147,"end":168,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"申請建築時，建築基地臨接公路者，建築物與公路間之距離，應依公路法及有關法令規定辦理；臨接其他道路者，應自道路邊線退縮二公尺以上建築；建築基地未臨接道路者，應以通路連接道路，通路之寬度應在二公尺以上。\n集中興建之房屋，應有完整之道路系統，道路寬度不得小於六公尺。","id":"D0070153/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"370e8f450d2e6d0858aaf197fe40ff10c26dd0331ad9f5eb3d3f135e9cce5e5e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":100,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:4/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":100,"end":130,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"建築物非經申請縣主管建築機關之審查許可並發給執照，不得擅自建造或使用或拆除。但合於建築法第七十八條及第九十八條規定者，不在此限。","id":"D0070153/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"c5ace36f3cd9d1ccf0ffb8cf30713a997575c356e881a93e05e79349506fafe5","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":64,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"申請建造執照或雜項執照，應備具左列文件向該縣主管建築機關為之：\n一、申請書。\n二、土地登記簿謄本或土地使用同意書。\n三、建築物平面略圖（比例尺不得小於二百分之一）、立面略圖（比例尺不得小於二百分之一）、配置圖（比例尺不得小於一千二百分之一）及位置圖。","id":"D0070153/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"00444dc06dd653a4171bcdc9a4ca91d1581842b15a2c2290e516e5b13f358a6d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":125,"children":[{"id":"D0070153/a:6/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":32,"end":39,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:6/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":39,"end":58,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:6/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":58,"end":125,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"主管建築機關自收到申請建築書件之次日起，應於十日內會同有關機關審查完竣，合格者即發給建造執照。但需要現地勘查者得予延長，最長不得超過三十日。\n前項工程圖說之審查，必要時得委託具有建築師資格之人員辦理。","id":"D0070153/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"e3a4a32527a6d4ce1b76a52563016610fe48a48c1de6a6a6d129b5cce0ce13c0","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":71,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:7/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":71,"end":100,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"起造人領得建造執照後，應依照建築期限建築完成，因故不能於期限內竣工時，得申請展期。但以二次為限，每次不得超過六個月，逾期執照作廢。\n前項建築期限由縣主管建築機關定之。","id":"D0070153/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"0fa45699f5de9118f8d521b808ba51b6ab22003652d6879369536e712e899867","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":66,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:8/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":66,"end":83,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"建築物興建完竣後，應由起造人會同承造人申請使用執照，該縣主管建築機關應自接到申請之日起十日內派員查驗，其經依法查驗合乎規定者，應即發給使用執照。","id":"D0070153/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"161dc5a29279640c0cf8ae1a70678a2004fe5130d682061976c33a321d75535d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":72,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"申請使用執照，應備具申請書，並檢附左列各件：\n一、原領之建造執照或雜項執照。\n二、建築物竣工平面圖及立面圖。\n建築物與核定工程圖樣完全相符者，免附竣工平面圖及立面圖。","id":"D0070153/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"4f9b9c471a5c63e022eb4693704fee0c257489e6a91c5414e86012057a354a61","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":55,"children":[{"id":"D0070153/a:10/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":23,"end":39,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:10/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":39,"end":55,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070153/a:10/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":55,"end":83,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"縣主管建築機關核發執照時，應依左列規定，向建築物之起造人或所有人收取規費或工本費：\n一、建造執照及雜項執照：按建築物造價或雜項工作物造價收取千分之一以下之規費，如有變更設計時，應按變更部分收取千分之一以下之規費。\n二、使用執照：收取執照工本費。\n三、拆除執照：免費發給。","id":"D0070153/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"92a8cdc9c0490b15e968b5cfec0887293139268fed12b088e44554be5c061bc5","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":135,"children":[{"id":"D0070153/a:11/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":42,"end":107,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:11/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":107,"end":123,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070153/a:11/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":123,"end":135,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"建築物非經領得使用執照，不准接水、接電或申請營業登記及使用；非經領得變更使用執照，不得變更其使用。","id":"D0070153/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"b00c57cc5665926b6416f4e416727aba4a7590c71d5f76089ccebd3b30de7362","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":49,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":[],"text":"縣政府對於建築物有關交通、景觀、環保、防火或防空避難等之設計與構造，於不違反法律規定範圍內，得會同有關機關為必要之規定。","id":"D0070153/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"695cdb36830a5696185c7bdc6a6b5999a897182cced3d26cfe9a03833ab68296","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":60,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 14 條","path":[],"text":"違反本辦法規定擅自建築或使用者，依建築法令有關規定處理。","id":"D0070153/a:14","anchor":"a-14","contentHash":"e2f4395a548892ecb766e44581b4bf109f6ee70fb6e565bded9484a411b8b882","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:14/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":28,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 15 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"D0070153/a:15","anchor":"a-15","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070153/a:15/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國八十一年十一月五日內政部（81）台內營字第 8188866  號令\n  訂定發布全文 15 條；並自發布日起施行","id":"D0070153","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"1992-11-05","name":"金門馬祖建築法適用地區外建築物管理辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070153","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"7fc7b230f9ae56c12844043983787692e8cab3021a77681cbfc82a6b1222454b","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"1992-11-05","effectiveDate":""}}